1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,337
Video ya leo inahusu nini? Mpango wa safari.

2
00:00:07,337 --> 00:00:08,837
Sehemu ya 1: Mpango wa Safari ya Onsen / Kupanga Safari ya Chemchem za Moto

3
00:00:08,837 --> 00:00:12,875
Je, wacha tuende onsen wikendi hii?

4
00:00:12,898 --> 00:00:16,265
Siku hizi ninauchoka sana.

5
00:00:16,287 --> 00:00:18,055
Sawa sana!

6
00:00:18,079 --> 00:00:20,974
Mimi pia ningependa kupumzika kwa utulivu.

7
00:00:20,997 --> 00:00:26,641
Ninawaswali kati ya Hakone na Izu, niambie unadhani ipi ni bora?

8
00:00:26,665 --> 00:00:28,465
Hmm.

9
00:00:28,488 --> 00:00:32,344
Hakone iko karibu zaidi kuliko Izu.

10
00:00:32,368 --> 00:00:38,455
Lakini Izu ina mandhari nzuri zaidi na unaweza kula samaki tamu.

11
00:00:38,478 --> 00:00:41,933
Kwa hiyo, je, tujaribu Izu?

12
00:00:41,957 --> 00:00:44,253
Ndiyo, hivyo tutafanya.

13
00:00:44,276 --> 00:00:46,409
Tutakwenda kwa treni?

14
00:00:46,432 --> 00:00:51,632
Nadhani gari ni bora zaidi kuliko treni.

15
00:00:51,655 --> 00:00:55,137
Lakini barabara zinaweza kuwa za msongamano wikendi hii.

16
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:57,094
Kweli kabisa.

17
00:00:57,117 --> 00:01:00,556
Kwa treni unaweza kunywa pia.

18
00:01:00,579 --> 00:01:03,512
Sawa, basi tutakwenda kwa treni.

19
00:01:03,535 --> 00:01:06,669
Nitakubali tiketi.

20
00:01:06,692 --> 00:01:08,258
Asante sana.

21
00:01:08,281 --> 00:01:10,856
Je, hoteli itakuwaje?

22
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:13,913
Ningependa hoteli ambayo ina maono ya bahari.

23
00:01:13,936 --> 00:01:16,915
Nitaangalia kwa mtandao.

24
00:01:16,939 --> 00:01:19,872
Chakula cha jioni tutakula hoteli?

25
00:01:19,895 --> 00:01:23,666
Nadhani ni rahisi zaidi kulia nje ya hoteli.

26
00:01:23,690 --> 00:01:29,293
Basi nitatafuta ikiwa kuna maduka mazuri karibu.

27
00:01:29,317 --> 00:01:30,732
Asante kwa msaada wako.

28
00:01:30,756 --> 00:01:34,922
Ningependa kuingia onsen mara mbili, usiku na asubuhi.

29
00:01:34,945 --> 00:01:36,679
Sawa sana!

30
00:01:36,702 --> 00:01:40,635
Kuingia bafuni pana hutoa raha na kufuta uchovu.

31
00:01:40,658 --> 00:01:45,673
Ningependa kununua zawadi pia, kwa hiyo nitachukua pesa zaidi kidogo.

32
00:01:45,697 --> 00:01:48,863
Mimi ningependa kununua samaki kavu.

33
00:01:48,886 --> 00:01:53,154
Basi, asubuhi ya Jumapili tutaenda sokoni.

34
00:01:53,177 --> 00:01:54,832
Inaonekana ya kupendeza!

35
00:01:54,856 --> 00:01:57,856
Tutakwenda saa ngapi?

36
00:01:57,879 --> 00:02:01,969
Ni bora tutoke mapema asubuhi, sivyo?

37
00:02:01,993 --> 00:02:03,932
Saa mbili ni sawa?

38
00:02:03,955 --> 00:02:06,040
Sawa.

39
00:02:06,063 --> 00:02:09,557
Tutakutana kwenye lango la tiketi katika stesheni ya Tokyo.

40
00:02:09,581 --> 00:02:12,278
Usichelewe, tafadhali.

41
00:02:12,302 --> 00:02:13,971
Hakuna matata.

42
00:02:13,994 --> 00:02:16,794
Nitaweka saa ya kuzindua.

43
00:02:16,817 --> 00:02:20,656
Nitakutumia ujumbe mara tu nitakapokamilisha uhifadhi wa hoteli.

44
00:02:20,679 --> 00:02:22,162
Tafadhali.

45
00:02:22,186 --> 00:02:24,655
Ninangoja kwa hamu safari hii!

46
00:02:24,679 --> 00:02:26,212
Ndiyo.

47
00:02:26,235 --> 00:02:31,242
Kutokana na hamu ya safari, ninaona nitaweza kufanya kazi vizuri kuanzia wiki ijayo.

48
00:02:31,266 --> 00:02:34,645
Jihadhari usije ukapata mafua.

49
00:02:34,669 --> 00:02:36,043
Asante sana.

50
00:02:36,066 --> 00:02:38,000
Usiku mwema.

51
00:02:38,023 --> 00:02:47,032
Skripu ya video ya leo inapatikana kupitia maelezo na maoni ya juu. Tafadhali achia maoni kabla ya kushusha.

52
00:02:47,032 --> 00:02:48,532
Sehemu ya 2: Mpango wa Safari ya Hokkaido / Kupanga Safari ya Hokkaido

53
00:02:48,532 --> 00:02:53,065
Nina mpango wa kwenda Hokkaido wakati wa likizo ya joto.

54
00:02:53,088 --> 00:02:54,821
Sawa sana!

55
00:02:54,844 --> 00:02:58,211
Unaenda wapi katika Hokkaido?

56
00:02:58,234 --> 00:03:02,673
Ninataka kwenda Sapporo, Otaru na Furano.

57
00:03:02,697 --> 00:03:07,431
Hiyo inaweza kuwa ngumu kidogo kwa ratiba yako.

58
00:03:07,454 --> 00:03:09,187
Kweli?

59
00:03:09,210 --> 00:03:13,180
Nimefikiri kwa siku tatu nitaweza kutembelea maeneo yote.

60
00:03:13,204 --> 00:03:19,080
Hokkaido ni kubwa sana, na kusafiri kunachukua muda mwingi.

61
00:03:19,104 --> 00:03:23,739
Ninafikiri kusafiri kwa treni, unaona je?

62
00:03:23,762 --> 00:03:28,835
Kama unataka kwenda Furano, ni bora ukodishe gari.

63
00:03:28,859 --> 00:03:33,026
Sipendi kuendesha gari sana.

64
00:03:33,049 --> 00:03:37,457
Kama ni hivyo, kwa nini usijisajili kwa ziara ya basi?

65
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:41,080
Kwa ziara, sitahitaji kuendesha, ndio?

66
00:03:41,104 --> 00:03:45,437
Ndiyo, utafika mahali unapolenga hata ukiwa unalala.

67
00:03:45,460 --> 00:03:50,727
Kwa upande mwingine, je naweza kwenda kutoka Sapporo hadi Otaru kwa treni?

68
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:54,521
Ndiyo, unaweza kwenda kwa treni kwa saa moja hivi.

69
00:03:54,545 --> 00:03:58,278
Nataka kula sushi nzuri huko Otaru.

70
00:03:58,301 --> 00:04:02,997
Kuna maduka mengi maarufu ya sushi huko Otaru.

71
00:04:03,021 --> 00:04:06,027
Unajua maduka yoyote yanayopendekezwa?

72
00:04:06,050 --> 00:04:08,816
Nitauliza rafiki yangu.

73
00:04:08,839 --> 00:04:10,706
Asante sana.

74
00:04:10,729 --> 00:04:14,862
Ninataka kula ramen huko Sapporo.

75
00:04:14,885 --> 00:04:17,539
Nakushauri kula ramen ya miso.

76
00:04:17,562 --> 00:04:21,162
Ninataka kuona mashamba ya maua huko Furano.

77
00:04:21,185 --> 00:04:22,823
Nzuri sana!

78
00:04:22,847 --> 00:04:24,903
Mashamba ya lavender?

79
00:04:24,926 --> 00:04:28,360
Ndiyo, inasemekana ni ya kuvutia sana.

80
00:04:28,383 --> 00:04:31,639
Tafadhali piga picha nyingi na uje nazo.

81
00:04:31,663 --> 00:04:33,632
Hakika, nitafanya hivyo.

82
00:04:33,656 --> 00:04:36,132
Unataka niletee nini kama zawadi?

83
00:04:36,156 --> 00:04:39,132
Tafadhali niletee 'Shiroi Koibito'.

84
00:04:39,156 --> 00:04:40,831
Sawa.

85
00:04:40,854 --> 00:04:43,787
Nitakumbuka na kuandika ili nisije nikisahau.

86
00:04:43,810 --> 00:04:46,545
Je, umefanya tayari uhifadhi wa hoteli?

87
00:04:46,569 --> 00:04:49,211
Hapana, bado.

88
00:04:49,234 --> 00:04:51,603
Fanya haraka uhifadhi.

89
00:04:51,626 --> 00:04:55,662
Wakati wa likizo ya joto, hoteli hujaa, ni bora ufanye haraka.

90
00:04:55,686 --> 00:04:59,086
Nitahifadhi mara tu nitakaporudi nyumbani leo.

91
00:04:59,109 --> 00:05:06,214
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

92
00:05:06,214 --> 00:05:07,714
Sehemu ya 3: Mpango wa Safari ya Kyoto

93
00:05:07,714 --> 00:05:12,081
Mwezi ujao nitaenda Kyoto kwa safari.

94
00:05:12,103 --> 00:05:14,503
Kyoto ni nzuri sana!

95
00:05:14,526 --> 00:05:17,540
Unaenda kutazama wapi?

96
00:05:17,564 --> 00:05:22,997
Ninataka kutembelea Kiyomizu-dera, Kinkaku-ji na Fushimi Inari.

97
00:05:23,020 --> 00:05:26,620
Una mpango wa kutembelea maeneo yote kwa usiku mmoja na siku mbili?

98
00:05:26,643 --> 00:05:28,243
Ndiyo.

99
00:05:28,266 --> 00:05:31,870
Lakini inawezekana muda hautatosha.

100
00:05:31,894 --> 00:05:37,566
Barabara za Kyoto huwa na msongamano, kwa hiyo treni ni bora kuliko basi.

101
00:05:37,589 --> 00:05:39,470
Ni kweli?

102
00:05:39,494 --> 00:05:42,831
Nimefikiri basi ni rahisi zaidi.

103
00:05:42,855 --> 00:05:46,351
Hasa wakati wa majira ya autumn, huwa na msongamano.

104
00:05:46,374 --> 00:05:49,541
Ni bora uutumie metro.

105
00:05:49,564 --> 00:05:50,931
Sawa.

106
00:05:50,954 --> 00:05:54,820
Siku ya kwanza, ni wapi unapendekeza nione?

107
00:05:54,843 --> 00:05:59,250
Napendekeza uende Fushimi Inari mapema asubuhi.

108
00:05:59,274 --> 00:06:02,840
Je, ni kwa sababu wakati wa mchana kuna watu wengi?

109
00:06:02,863 --> 00:06:04,397
Ndiyo.

110
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:09,986
Pia, ikiwa unataka kupiga picha, asubuhi ndio wakati bora kwa picha nzuri.

111
00:06:10,009 --> 00:06:13,643
Baada ya hapo, tutaenda Kiyomizu-dera.

112
00:06:13,666 --> 00:06:16,466
Chakula cha mchana tutakula vipi?

113
00:06:16,489 --> 00:06:20,155
Nataka kula kitindamlo cha matcha kitamu.

114
00:06:20,178 --> 00:06:24,469
Kuna kafe maarufu karibu na Kiyomizu-dera.

115
00:06:24,493 --> 00:06:27,093
Ningependa kujaribu.

116
00:06:27,116 --> 00:06:29,767
Je, ni vyema kufanya uhifadhi?

117
00:06:29,790 --> 00:06:34,645
Tafadhali angalia kwenye mtandao ikiwa unaweza kufanya uhifadhi.

118
00:06:34,668 --> 00:06:38,802
Ninafikiria kwenda Kinkaku-ji siku ya pili.

119
00:06:38,825 --> 00:06:44,268
Kinkaku-ji ni nzuri wakati wa jioni kwa sababu nuru ya jua inamulika vizuri.

120
00:06:44,291 --> 00:06:46,491
Ni nzuri sana!

121
00:06:46,514 --> 00:06:50,081
Ningependa kukodisha kimono na kutembea nayo.

122
00:06:50,104 --> 00:06:54,879
Labda unahitaji kufanya uhifadhi wa kimono mapema.

123
00:06:54,902 --> 00:06:56,955
Ndiyo?

124
00:06:56,978 --> 00:07:00,378
Nitakumbuka kufanya uhifadhi mapema.

125
00:07:00,401 --> 00:07:05,468
Lakini, kutembea akiwa amevaa kimono kunaweza kukufanya uchovu kidogo.

126
00:07:05,491 --> 00:07:08,224
Kama nitachoka, nitapanda teksi.

127
00:07:08,247 --> 00:07:12,465
Unaweza kununua zawadi kwenye stesheni ya Kyoto.

128
00:07:12,489 --> 00:07:16,706
Basi, nitanunua zawadi kabla ya kurudi kwenye stesheni.

129
00:07:16,730 --> 00:07:19,396
Ninapendekeza Yatsuhashi.

130
00:07:19,419 --> 00:07:22,753
Sijawahi kununua, basi nitanunua.

131
00:07:22,776 --> 00:07:25,576
Natumai utakuwa safari ya furaha!

132
00:07:25,599 --> 00:07:29,481
Ndiyo, ninafurahia sana kuanzia sasa.

133
00:07:29,505 --> 00:07:31,005
Sehemu ya 4: Chagua Hoteli kwa Safari Yako ya Okinawa

134
00:07:31,005 --> 00:07:35,138
Ninatafuta hoteli kwa safari yangu ya Okinawa.

135
00:07:35,161 --> 00:07:37,740
Unataka kukaa hoteli ya aina gani?

136
00:07:37,764 --> 00:07:41,897
Ninapendelea hoteli ya bei nafuu na inayoonekana bahari.

137
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:46,687
Hotel karibu na bahari zinaweza kuwa ghali kidogo.

138
00:07:46,710 --> 00:07:50,930
Bajeti yangu ni kama elfu kumi kwa usiku mmoja.

139
00:07:50,953 --> 00:07:55,624
Kwenye jiji la Naha, kuna hoteli nyingi za bei nafuu.

140
00:07:55,647 --> 00:08:00,447
Je, naweza kutembea kutoka hoteli mjini hadi bahari?

141
00:08:00,470 --> 00:08:03,673
Kutembea ni vigumu kidogo.

142
00:08:03,696 --> 00:08:05,909
Unahitaji gari.

143
00:08:05,932 --> 00:08:10,899
Sina uzoefu wa kuendesha, kwa hiyo siwezi kuendesha.

144
00:08:10,923 --> 00:08:15,412
Kama ni hivyo, hoteli karibu na kituo cha monorail itakuwa rahisi.

145
00:08:15,435 --> 00:08:20,002
Ninawaswa kati ya kupendelea urahisi au mandhari.

146
00:08:20,025 --> 00:08:25,592
Je, kama ungecheza baharini mchana na kulala mjini usiku ungependa?

147
00:08:25,615 --> 00:08:27,948
Hiyo pia ni wazo zuri.

148
00:08:27,971 --> 00:08:31,704
Ni rahisi pia kwa ajili ya chakula cha jioni.

149
00:08:31,728 --> 00:08:35,798
Kuna maduka mengi ya vyakula vizuri mjini Naha.

150
00:08:35,821 --> 00:08:39,588
Je, ni vyema kula chakula cha asubuhi kwenye hoteli?

151
00:08:39,611 --> 00:08:45,579
Ninafikiri ni bora kuwa na mpango wa chakula cha asubuhi ili kuwa rahisi.

152
00:08:45,603 --> 00:08:48,136
Nimepata hoteli hii kwenye mtandao.

153
00:08:48,159 --> 00:08:49,526
Ikoje?

154
00:08:49,549 --> 00:08:54,682
Iko karibu na kituo, lakini vyumba vinaonekana vidogo kidogo.

155
00:08:54,705 --> 00:08:59,279
Mimi nitalala tu, kwa hiyo ukubwa wa chumba si tatizo.

156
00:08:59,302 --> 00:09:02,550
Basi, je, ungependelea hoteli hii?

157
00:09:02,573 --> 00:09:04,306
Hmm.

158
00:09:04,329 --> 00:09:07,863
Nitapitia maoni ya watumiaji kwanza kabla ya kuamua.

159
00:09:07,886 --> 00:09:10,022
Hiyo ni nzuri sana.

160
00:09:10,045 --> 00:09:14,978
Aa, hapa kimeandikwa kuwa wafanyakazi ni wazuri sana.

161
00:09:15,001 --> 00:09:17,801
Hivyo basi, ninafurahia.

162
00:09:17,824 --> 00:09:20,065
Nitafanya hifadhi hapa.

163
00:09:20,089 --> 00:09:23,255
Umeshauzia tiketi ya ndege?

164
00:09:23,278 --> 00:09:24,678
Ndiyo.

165
00:09:24,701 --> 00:09:27,436
Nilinunua miezi miwili iliyopita.

166
00:09:27,460 --> 00:09:30,340
Kama unanunua mapema, huwa ni rahisi.

167
00:09:30,364 --> 00:09:33,830
Nimeamua hoteli, ninafurahia sana.

168
00:09:33,853 --> 00:09:37,590
Usisahau kuchukua mavazi ya kuogelea.

169
00:09:37,613 --> 00:09:38,780
Ndiyo.

170
00:09:38,803 --> 00:09:41,978
Ninafikiri ninunue mavazi mapya ya kuogelea.

171
00:09:42,001 --> 00:09:44,978
Safari njema, na uwe waangalifu.

172
00:09:45,001 --> 00:09:46,568
Asante sana.

173
00:09:46,591 --> 00:09:48,806
Nitakufurahia sana.

174
00:09:48,829 --> 00:09:50,329
Mandhari 5: Utalii wa Kanazawa / Utangulizi wa Safari ya Kanazawa

175
00:09:50,329 --> 00:09:54,742
Mkuu, nataka kwenda safari ya ndani kwa mara yangu ya kwanza.

176
00:09:54,766 --> 00:09:56,421
Sawa sana!

177
00:09:56,444 --> 00:09:59,341
Unataka kwenda wapi?

178
00:09:59,364 --> 00:10:04,642
Nataka mahali ninapoweza kula samaki tamu na ni mahali pa utulivu.

179
00:10:04,666 --> 00:10:07,884
Kama ni hivyo, Kanazawa ni nini?

180
00:10:07,908 --> 00:10:10,141
Kanazawa?

181
00:10:10,165 --> 00:10:12,298
Ni mji wa aina gani?

182
00:10:12,321 --> 00:10:16,695
Kuna majengo ya kale na ni mji mzuri sana.

183
00:10:16,719 --> 00:10:19,485
Samaki wana ladha nzuri?

184
00:10:19,508 --> 00:10:20,842
Ndiyo,

185
00:10:20,865 --> 00:10:25,242
Unaweza kula sushi na donburi ya samaki kwa wingi sokoni.

186
00:10:25,265 --> 00:10:28,037
Hiyo ni nzuri kabisa.

187
00:10:28,061 --> 00:10:31,828
Kutoka Tokyo, nawezaje kwenda huko?

188
00:10:31,851 --> 00:10:34,538
Unaweza kwenda kwa Shinkansen.

189
00:10:34,561 --> 00:10:37,254
Inachukua muda gani?

190
00:10:37,278 --> 00:10:40,245
Inachukua saa mbili na nusu hivi.

191
00:10:40,268 --> 00:10:42,802
Ni karibu zaidi kuliko nilivyofikiri.

192
00:10:42,825 --> 00:10:46,792
Kuna bustani maarufu inayoitwa Kenrokuen.

193
00:10:46,815 --> 00:10:50,548
Kuzunguka bustani pia kina furaha, sivyo?

194
00:10:50,571 --> 00:10:54,818
Aiskrimu yenye dhahabu pia ni maarufu huko.

195
00:10:54,842 --> 00:10:57,087
Dhahabu?

196
00:10:57,110 --> 00:10:59,044
Ningependa kuionja.

197
00:10:59,067 --> 00:11:04,433
Kuna mvua nyingi, kwa hivyo ni vyema kuchukua mwavuli.

198
00:11:04,456 --> 00:11:07,824
Nitakuwa na mwavuli wa kubebea kwenye begi yangu.

199
00:11:07,847 --> 00:11:12,181
Kuna makumbusho ya sanaa ambayo si maarufu sana, basi ni vyema uziende.

200
00:11:12,204 --> 00:11:14,937
Napenda kwenda makumbusho ya sanaa.

201
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:19,760
Nitakupa habari za hoteli ambayo ninaishi mara kwa mara.

202
00:11:19,783 --> 00:11:21,618
Kweli?

203
00:11:21,641 --> 00:11:23,208
Asante sana.

204
00:11:23,231 --> 00:11:27,070
Ni hoteli ambayo chakula chake ni tamu sana.

205
00:11:27,093 --> 00:11:29,929
Nimechoshwa kusubiri kwenda huko.

206
00:11:29,953 --> 00:11:35,604
Kwa habari yako, wakati wa majira ya baridi huko Kanazawa, kaa huwa na ladha nzuri sana.

207
00:11:35,628 --> 00:11:42,261
Napenda kaa sana, ingawa sasa si wakati, ningependa kwenda majira ya baridi pia.

208
00:11:42,284 --> 00:11:46,525
Ni vyema kununua tiketi za Shinkansen mapema.

209
00:11:46,548 --> 00:11:47,847
Ndiyo,

210
00:11:47,871 --> 00:11:51,871
Baada ya kuamua ratiba, nitakwenda kununua tiketi stesheni mara moja.

211
00:11:51,894 --> 00:11:55,894
Kama una maswali yoyote, unaweza kuuliza wakati wowote.

212
00:11:55,917 --> 00:11:57,451
Asante sana.

213
00:11:57,474 --> 00:11:59,940
Umenisaidia sana.

214
00:11:59,963 --> 00:12:01,463
Mandhari 6: Mbinu ya Mapema kwa Mbuga za Burudani / Mbinu ya Kufika Mapema kwa Mbuga za Burudani

215
00:12:01,463 --> 00:12:05,297
Je, tutaenda mbuga ya burudani wikendi hii?

216
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:08,007
Ninataka kwenda.

217
00:12:08,030 --> 00:12:12,030
Lakini, mwishoni mwa wiki kuna watu wengi, sivyo?

218
00:12:12,053 --> 00:12:16,886
Ninafikiria kuamka mapema ili niweze kwenda kabla ya bustani kufunguliwa.

219
00:12:16,909 --> 00:12:20,343
Una mpango wa kutoka saa ngapi asubuhi?

220
00:12:20,366 --> 00:12:23,766
Kama tutaondoka nyumbani saa kumi na mbili, je?

221
00:12:23,789 --> 00:12:26,283
Hiyo ni mapema sana!

222
00:12:26,306 --> 00:12:30,840
Lakini kwa njia hiyo tutaweza kupanda vivutio vingi zaidi.

223
00:12:30,863 --> 00:12:34,829
Nataka kuwa mtu wa kwanza kupanda roller coaster maarufu.

224
00:12:34,852 --> 00:12:37,823
Je, tayari una tiketi?

225
00:12:37,847 --> 00:12:39,890
Bado.

226
00:12:39,913 --> 00:12:43,350
Nitai nunua mtandaoni kesho.

227
00:12:43,374 --> 00:12:46,815
Ni vyema uweke programu ya simu pia.

228
00:12:46,839 --> 00:12:50,486
Programu hiyo inasaidia vipi?

229
00:12:50,510 --> 00:12:54,043
Unaweza kupata Fast Pass kupitia programu hiyo.

230
00:12:54,066 --> 00:12:56,433
Hiyo ni rahisi sana!

231
00:12:56,456 --> 00:12:58,742
Nitaweka haraka.

232
00:12:58,765 --> 00:13:01,570
Chakula cha mchana tutakula vipi?

233
00:13:01,593 --> 00:13:03,993
Mikahawa pia huwa na watu wengi.

234
00:13:04,016 --> 00:13:07,862
Tukale kabla ya kuja watu wengi, saa tano hivi.

235
00:13:07,886 --> 00:13:12,619
Labda mikahawa inaweza kuhifadhiwa, nitatafuta habari.

236
00:13:12,642 --> 00:13:14,313
Tafadhali.

237
00:13:14,336 --> 00:13:17,607
Nataka kuona parade usiku.

238
00:13:17,630 --> 00:13:22,997
Usiku kunaweza kuwa baridi, ni vyema kuchukua koti.

239
00:13:23,020 --> 00:13:26,953
Nina mpango wa kwenda na viatu vinavyorahisisha kutembea.

240
00:13:26,976 --> 00:13:30,709
Katika bustani ya mandhari, tunatembea sana.

241
00:13:30,732 --> 00:13:34,205
Tukikosa nguvu, tutaacha katika kafe.

242
00:13:34,229 --> 00:13:37,806
Kula popcorn wakati wa kutembea ni furaha pia.

243
00:13:37,830 --> 00:13:40,967
Nimesikia kuna aina nyingi za popcorn.

244
00:13:40,990 --> 00:13:44,240
Mimi napenda aina ya karameli.

245
00:13:44,264 --> 00:13:46,939
Mimi napenda aina ya chumvi.

246
00:13:46,962 --> 00:13:48,810
Tununue zote mbili.

247
00:13:48,833 --> 00:13:51,070
Je, utakwenda kwa treni?

248
00:13:51,093 --> 00:13:53,093
Au kwa gari?

249
00:13:53,117 --> 00:13:56,491
Ninafikiri gari ni bora kwa sababu haitoingi.

250
00:13:56,515 --> 00:13:59,735
Basi, nitatoa gari yangu.

251
00:13:59,758 --> 00:14:01,527
Kweli?

252
00:14:01,551 --> 00:14:03,084
Asante sana.

253
00:14:03,107 --> 00:14:06,507
Lazima nijaze mafuta ya gari.

254
00:14:06,530 --> 00:14:09,497
Ninangojea sana mwisho wa wiki huu.

255
00:14:09,519 --> 00:14:11,019
Sehemu ya 7: Kutembea na kula huko Osaka / Osaka Food Crawl

256
00:14:11,019 --> 00:14:17,297
Nataka kula vyakula vyenye ladha vingi huko Osaka.

257
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:20,720
Huko Osaka, tako-yaki na okonomiyaki ndiyo bora.

258
00:14:20,743 --> 00:14:24,614
Ninataka kula kushikatsu kwa hakika.

259
00:14:24,637 --> 00:14:28,437
Una mpango wa kula vyote kwa siku moja?

260
00:14:28,460 --> 00:14:32,142
Ndiyo, nitakwenda na njaa kubwa.

261
00:14:32,166 --> 00:14:38,332
Kama utaenda Dotonbori, utaona maduka yote ya aina hiyo yako huko.

262
00:14:38,355 --> 00:14:42,795
Kwanza, nataka kula tako-yaki wakati wa kutembea.

263
00:14:42,818 --> 00:14:48,585
Kula wakati wa kutembea ni furaha, lakini angalia usije ukajikuna.

264
00:14:48,608 --> 00:14:52,216
Vyakula vipya vina joto sana.

265
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:56,921
Baada ya tako-yaki, tutaendelea na okonomiyaki.

266
00:14:56,944 --> 00:15:01,478
Nimesikia okonomiyaki huliwa pamoja na wali.

267
00:15:01,501 --> 00:15:05,434
Watu wa Osaka hula hivyo.

268
00:15:05,457 --> 00:15:09,148
Hii itakuwa kabohaidreti tu.

269
00:15:09,171 --> 00:15:14,665
Wakati wa safari, unaweza kusahau kidogo juu ya mlo wa lishe.

270
00:15:14,689 --> 00:15:18,422
Ndiyo, nafikiri ni vizuri tukale kwa wingi.

271
00:15:18,445 --> 00:15:22,692
Usiku tutakwenda kwa duka la kushika nyama kwa nyuzi na kunywa bia.

272
00:15:22,716 --> 00:15:27,249
Sosi ya nyama kwa nyuzi haiwezi kurudia mara mbili, ndiyo?

273
00:15:27,272 --> 00:15:31,140
Lazima tuilinde sheria wakati tunakula.

274
00:15:31,164 --> 00:15:35,534
Je, ni vyema kutengeneza nafasi katika duka la nyama kwa nyuzi?

275
00:15:35,557 --> 00:15:40,933
Maduka maarufu huwa na foleni, hivyo ni vyema kutengeneza nafasi mapema.

276
00:15:40,956 --> 00:15:45,190
Basi, nitatengeneza nafasi mtandaoni.

277
00:15:45,213 --> 00:15:49,679
Unajua duka lolote ambalo huuza mbuzi waliopikwa vizuri?

278
00:15:49,702 --> 00:15:52,585
Unamaanisha duka maarufu lililopo Namba?

279
00:15:52,609 --> 00:15:56,642
Ndiyo, kila wakati kuna foleni.

280
00:15:56,665 --> 00:15:59,999
Ningependa kununua kama zawadi pia.

281
00:16:00,022 --> 00:16:04,288
Kama utalia katika jokofu ya hoteli, itakuwa salama.

282
00:16:04,311 --> 00:16:08,345
Unaweza kula kwa chakula cha asubuhi siku iliyofuata.

283
00:16:08,368 --> 00:16:12,734
Nina wasiwasi kwamba ninaweza kupata maumivu ya tumbo kwa sababu ya kula sana.

284
00:16:12,757 --> 00:16:16,290
Nimechukua dawa ya tumbo, hivyo hakuna matatizo.

285
00:16:16,313 --> 00:16:18,947
Hiyo inanipa amani.

286
00:16:18,970 --> 00:16:21,543
Tufanye ziara ya kula kwa furaha!

287
00:16:21,566 --> 00:16:24,166
Ninahisi furaha sasa hivi!

288
00:16:24,189 --> 00:16:25,689
Sehemu ya 8: Mipango mbadala kwa siku za mvua

289
00:16:25,689 --> 00:16:30,662
Kuhusu kambi ya mwishoni mwa wiki, hali ya hewa inaonekana mbaya.

290
00:16:30,686 --> 00:16:33,286
Umeangalia utabiri wa hali ya hewa?

291
00:16:33,309 --> 00:16:38,443
Ndiyo, Jumamosi inatarajiwa mvua.

292
00:16:38,466 --> 00:16:41,961
Kambi wakati wa mvua ni ngumu.

293
00:16:41,984 --> 00:16:46,817
Kama itanyesha mvua, je, tuende mahali pengine?

294
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:50,914
Badala ya kambi, tutaenda wapi?

295
00:16:50,938 --> 00:16:56,477
Unaweza kwenda akwariamu au jumba la makumbusho, hata kama kunyesha mvua utapata furaha bila kunawanywa.

296
00:16:56,501 --> 00:16:59,278
Ningependa kwenda akwariamu.

297
00:16:59,301 --> 00:17:01,435
Ningependa kuona pomboo.

298
00:17:01,458 --> 00:17:06,091
Kuna akwariamu kubwa karibu na hapa.

299
00:17:06,114 --> 00:17:09,124
Basi, tutaenda huko.

300
00:17:09,147 --> 00:17:14,123
Kama kunyesha mvua, tutahitaji kufuta kambi.

301
00:17:14,146 --> 00:17:17,680
Malipo ya kufuta yanafanya kuanzia lini?

302
00:17:17,703 --> 00:17:23,744
Kama ni siku tatu kabla, hakuna malipo, hivyo tutangoja hadi muda wa mwisho.

303
00:17:23,767 --> 00:17:25,252
Hmm.

304
00:17:25,275 --> 00:17:29,152
Utabiri wa hali ya hewa unaweza kubadilika.

305
00:17:29,175 --> 00:17:33,412
Kama itakuwa jua, tutaenda kambi kama ilivyopangwa.

306
00:17:33,436 --> 00:17:37,203
Je, tiketi za akwariamu tutazipataje?

307
00:17:37,226 --> 00:17:41,393
Nadhani zitaweza kununuliwa siku hiyo hiyo kwenye lango.

308
00:17:41,416 --> 00:17:44,622
Mimi ninafurahia chochote.

309
00:17:44,645 --> 00:17:49,378
Kwa usalama, sitafanya chakula cha mchana.

310
00:17:49,401 --> 00:17:53,448
Kuna mgahawa mzuri wowote karibu na akwariamu?

311
00:17:53,472 --> 00:17:57,238
Kuna mgahawa wa Kiitaliano.

312
00:17:57,261 --> 00:18:00,028
Ningependa kula pizza huko.

313
00:18:00,051 --> 00:18:04,217
Tutakuwa tayari kwa furaha hata kama kunyesha mvua.

314
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:07,840
Ni vyema kuchukua mwavuli na taulo.

315
00:18:07,863 --> 00:18:12,761
Tutatumia gari, hivyo hata kama mizigo itakuwa mingi, hakuna matatizo.

316
00:18:12,785 --> 00:18:15,551
Mimi nitakuja kukupokea.

317
00:18:15,574 --> 00:18:17,208
Asante sana.

318
00:18:17,231 --> 00:18:19,571
Saa tatu asubuhi, tafadhali.

319
00:18:19,594 --> 00:18:24,493
Basi, tutaangalia hali ya hewa tena usiku wa Ijumaa.

320
00:18:24,516 --> 00:18:26,083
Ndiyo.

321
00:18:26,106 --> 00:18:28,243
Asante sana.

322
00:18:28,266 --> 00:18:29,766
Mchezo wa 9: Mpango wa Kuendesha Gari kwenda Mlima Fuji

323
00:18:29,766 --> 00:18:33,810
Twende kuendesha gari karibu na Mlima Fuji.

324
00:18:33,833 --> 00:18:35,200
Sawa sana!

325
00:18:35,223 --> 00:18:37,869
Tutatumia gari la nani?

326
00:18:37,892 --> 00:18:40,980
Nitatoa gari langu.

327
00:18:41,004 --> 00:18:45,137
Ninaweza kuendesha pia, basi tutabadilishana njiani.

328
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,847
Asante kwa msaada wako.

329
00:18:46,871 --> 00:18:49,738
Twende kwa barabara kuu.

330
00:18:49,760 --> 00:18:53,927
Nitapita kwenye eneo la huduma la Ebina njiani.

331
00:18:53,950 --> 00:18:57,396
Huko panapatikana mkate wa meloni unaojulikana sana.

332
00:18:57,419 --> 00:18:58,986
Ndiyo.

333
00:18:59,009 --> 00:19:01,976
Nataka kununua na kula ndani ya gari.

334
00:19:01,999 --> 00:19:04,732
Tununue kahawa pia.

335
00:19:04,755 --> 00:19:08,955
Karibu na Mlima Fuji, tutapitia wapi?

336
00:19:08,978 --> 00:19:13,978
Ninafikiri tutaenda Ziwa Kawaguchiko na kupiga picha za Mlima Fuji.

337
00:19:14,001 --> 00:19:16,016
Ingekuwa vizuri kama itakuwa na jua.

338
00:19:16,039 --> 00:19:20,095
Nataka kula hōtō kwa chakula cha mchana.

339
00:19:20,119 --> 00:19:23,735
Hōtō ni tamu na moto, sivyo?

340
00:19:23,758 --> 00:19:27,292
Nitaingiza anwani ya mgahawa maarufu kwenye kivinjari.

341
00:19:27,315 --> 00:19:30,054
Je, tunaweza kupita kwenye vituo vya barabarani?

342
00:19:30,077 --> 00:19:31,444
Ndiyo.

343
00:19:31,466 --> 00:19:35,200
Ninataka kununua mboga freshi kwenye vituo vya barabarani.

344
00:19:35,223 --> 00:19:39,118
Kuangalia bidhaa za asili za eneo ni furaha, sivyo?

345
00:19:39,141 --> 00:19:45,074
Ningependa kwenda onsen (bafu ya moto) njiani nyumbani, je, tutakuwa na wakati?

346
00:19:45,097 --> 00:19:49,264
Nakini na jioni, tutaweza kwenda onsen kwa siku moja.

347
00:19:49,287 --> 00:19:53,320
Basi, lazima nichukue taulo.

348
00:19:53,343 --> 00:19:56,681
Nitachukua taulo ya ziada pia.

349
00:19:56,705 --> 00:19:59,841
Kuna uwezekano wa msongamano njiani nyumbani.

350
00:19:59,864 --> 00:20:03,998
Ni bora twende nyumbani mapema kabla ya msongamano.

351
00:20:04,021 --> 00:20:05,554
Hmm.

352
00:20:05,577 --> 00:20:09,344
Twende nyumbani saa tisa mchana hivi.

353
00:20:09,367 --> 00:20:12,533
Je, naweza kuchukua CD za muziki ninazozipenda?

354
00:20:12,556 --> 00:20:14,808
Hakika, nitafanya hivyo.

355
00:20:14,832 --> 00:20:17,365
Tutasikiliza wakati wa kuendesha gari.

356
00:20:17,388 --> 00:20:19,988
Twendeshe kwa usalama.

357
00:20:20,011 --> 00:20:21,245
Ndiyo.

358
00:20:21,268 --> 00:20:24,688
Nitahakikisha siendeshe kwa kasi mno.

359
00:20:24,711 --> 00:20:27,591
Ninangoja likizo ijayo kwa hamu.

360
00:20:27,614 --> 00:20:30,547
Tufanye kumbukumbu nyingi.

361
00:20:30,570 --> 00:20:32,070
Mchezo wa 10: Uthibitisho wa Maandalizi ya Safari

362
00:20:32,070 --> 00:20:35,404
Kesho tutaondoka kwa safari.

363
00:20:35,427 --> 00:20:36,427
Ndiyo.

364
00:20:36,450 --> 00:20:39,923
Je, umeandaa mizigo yako?

365
00:20:39,946 --> 00:20:42,319
Karibu nimeshaisha.

366
00:20:42,343 --> 00:20:45,476
Tuthibitishe vitu tunavyobeba.

367
00:20:45,499 --> 00:20:49,132
Je, umeweka pasipoti na tiketi kwenye begi?

368
00:20:49,155 --> 00:20:50,522
Ndiyo.

369
00:20:50,545 --> 00:20:54,878
Ni muhimu zaidi, kwa hiyo niliweka kwanza.

370
00:20:54,901 --> 00:20:57,757
Nani atabeba kamera?

371
00:20:57,780 --> 00:21:01,947
Mimi nina kamera nzuri, nitabeba.

372
00:21:01,970 --> 00:21:05,840
Usisahau chaji.

373
00:21:05,863 --> 00:21:08,714
Ninachaji sasa hivi.

374
00:21:08,737 --> 00:21:12,182
Mimi nitabeba kitabu cha mwongozo.

375
00:21:12,206 --> 00:21:13,617
Tafadhali.

376
00:21:13,640 --> 00:21:17,174
Je, unaweza kuchapisha ramani pia?

377
00:21:17,197 --> 00:21:20,604
Tayari nimeichapisha na kuweka kwenye faili.

378
00:21:20,628 --> 00:21:22,519
Asante kwa msaada wako.

379
00:21:22,542 --> 00:21:25,835
Je, ni vizuri kuchukua dawa?

380
00:21:25,858 --> 00:21:30,326
Ni bora kuchukua dawa ya mafua na dawa ya tumbo kwa usalama.

381
00:21:30,350 --> 00:21:34,117
Basi, nitakagua.

382
00:21:34,140 --> 00:21:36,828
Mimi nimenunua vitafunio.

383
00:21:36,851 --> 00:21:40,051
Nitakifurahia kula njiani.

384
00:21:40,074 --> 00:21:44,208
Inaweza kuwa vizuri kuchukua pesa taslimu kidogo zaidi.

385
00:21:44,231 --> 00:21:49,164
Je, ni kwa sababu kuna maduka ambayo hayakubali kadi ya mkopo?

386
00:21:49,187 --> 00:21:53,002
Ndiyo, kwa sababu tutaenda pia sehemu za vijijini.

387
00:21:53,026 --> 00:21:54,720
Sawa.

388
00:21:54,743 --> 00:21:57,242
Nitaondoa pesa benkini.

389
00:21:57,266 --> 00:22:00,999
Wakati wa kukutana kesho ni saa moja asubuhi, ndio?

390
00:22:01,022 --> 00:22:02,356
Ndiyo.

391
00:22:02,379 --> 00:22:05,379
Tukutane kwenye mlango wa kaskazini wa kituo cha treni.

392
00:22:05,402 --> 00:22:08,935
Lazima tujitahidi tusilale usingizi.

393
00:22:08,958 --> 00:22:12,125
Ni vizuri kulala mapema usiku huu.

394
00:22:12,148 --> 00:22:13,399
Ndiyo.

395
00:22:13,422 --> 00:22:16,897
Baada ya kukagua mizigo, nitalala mara moja.

396
00:22:16,920 --> 00:22:21,254
Tafadhali angalia tena ili kuhakikisha hamna chochote kilichosahaulika.

397
00:22:21,277 --> 00:22:23,753
Inapaswa kuwa sawa.

398
00:22:23,776 --> 00:22:26,817
Basi, tutaonana kituoni kesho.

399
00:22:26,840 --> 00:22:28,607
Usiku mwema.

400
00:22:28,630 --> 00:22:30,763
Nitakuwa na shukrani kesho.

401
00:22:30,786 --> 00:22:33,028
Usiku mwema.

402
00:22:42,688 --> 00:22:44,188
Sehemu ya 1: Mpango wa Safari ya Onsen / Kupanga Safari ya Chemchem za Moto

403
00:22:44,188 --> 00:22:48,464
Mtihani wa kusikiliza

404
00:22:48,464 --> 00:22:53,537
Je, wacha tuende onsen wikendi hii?

405
00:22:53,537 --> 00:23:00,483
Vませんか = Je, hufai...? / Kwa nini tusifanye...?
週末(しゅうまつ) = mwishoni mwa wiki
温泉(おんせん) = chemchem za moto

406
00:23:00,506 --> 00:23:04,206
Mtihani wa kusikiliza

407
00:23:04,206 --> 00:23:08,545
Siku hizi ninauchoka sana.

408
00:23:08,545 --> 00:23:14,519
Vて = ...na (kutoa sababu)
最近(さいきん) = hivi majuzi, karibuni
疲(つか)れる = kuchoka

409
00:23:14,543 --> 00:23:16,810
Mtihani wa kusikiliza

410
00:23:16,810 --> 00:23:19,344
Sawa sana!

411
00:23:22,904 --> 00:23:26,171
Mtihani wa kusikiliza

412
00:23:26,171 --> 00:23:30,004
Mimi pia ningependa kupumzika kwa utulivu.

413
00:23:30,004 --> 00:23:35,271
Vたい = nataka kufanya
休(やす)む = kupumzika, kuchukua likizo

414
00:23:35,294 --> 00:23:41,032
Mtihani wa kusikiliza

415
00:23:41,032 --> 00:23:47,932
Ninawaswali kati ya Hakone na Izu, niambie unadhani ipi ni bora?

416
00:23:47,932 --> 00:23:57,279
N1 と N2 で = kati ya N1 na N2
迷(まよ)う = kusita, kukatazamana
どちら = ipi (kati ya mbili)

417
00:23:57,302 --> 00:23:59,568
Mtihani wa kusikiliza

418
00:23:59,568 --> 00:24:02,119
Hmm.

419
00:24:05,709 --> 00:24:09,842
Mtihani wa kusikiliza

420
00:24:09,842 --> 00:24:14,742
Hakone iko karibu zaidi kuliko Izu.

421
00:24:14,742 --> 00:24:21,418
N1 のほうが N2 より = N1 ni zaidi ... kuliko N2
近(ちか)い (karibu) ↔ 遠(とお)い (mbali)

422
00:24:21,442 --> 00:24:27,575
Mtihani wa kusikiliza

423
00:24:27,575 --> 00:24:34,966
Lakini Izu ina mandhari nzuri zaidi na unaweza kula samaki tamu.

424
00:24:34,966 --> 00:24:44,999
〜し、〜し = ..., na... (kuorodhesha sababu)
景色(けしき) = mandhari, mazingira
魚(さかな) = samaki

